  "name": "Argynvostholt",
  "region": "argynvostholt",
  "summary": "The ruined house of the silver dragon Argynvost on its wooded ridge: a burned mansion, a dark beacon tower, a courtyard where the dragon fell, and the mausoleum where his headless bones lie. The dead knights of his Order still keep it.",
  "text": "A drive between dead trees climbs past the footings of a gatehouse into a courtyard of cracked flagstones. The mansion's black front fills the north side, its beacon tower above the east wing. A stone mausoleum stands apart to the east; the stables and the squires' graves are going back to the forest on the west.",
